# Meteor Falls (and the deep caves of Hoenn's story to come): a slow, wondering flute line in C minor over a falling
# harp, a choir's held chords and a deep bass, like water sounding in a great dark hall. A cave plays the same by day
# and night. Original composition for this game (plan 21 · H4, part a).
